{"id":"pilote","lemma":"pilote","pos":"noun","rank":1297,"glosses":["pilot (controller of aircraft)","pilot (controller of vessel)","driver (controller of a racecar)"],"ipa":"/pi.lɔt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bb/Fr-pilote.ogg/Fr-pilote.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"pilotes"},"formAudio":{"pilotes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dd/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-pilotes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Mon rêve est de devenir pilote.","en":"My dream is to become a pilot.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"dream"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to become"},null]},{"text":"Qui est le meilleur pilote ?","en":"Who's the better driver?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"best, better"},null]},{"text":"Il a décidé de devenir pilote.","en":"He decided to become a pilot.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to decide","l":"décider"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to become"},null]},{"text":"Plus tard, je veux devenir pilote.","en":"I want to be a pilot in the future.","words":[{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"late"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to become"},null]},{"text":"J'ai un ami qui est pilote.","en":"I have a friend who's a pilot.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"friend"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]}]}